<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Jan CPI rises 1.2 pct mo/mo, +7.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Jan CPI rises 1.2 pct mo/mo, +7.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech consumer prices rose 1.2 percent in January putting prices 7.4 percent higher than in the same month of last year, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
</text>
